# wip606: the MUTE / SOLO mode stays when PERFORM is left and entered again (FILL lit = SOLO, tracks can keep being soloed)
wait 300
tap FX
tap FX
wait 100
expect msmode 0
tapkey b9
wait 50
expect msmode 1
tapkey b0
tap HOME
wait 100
tap FX
wait 100
expect msmode 1
